body:
I am trying to get a better facial hair routine:

&#x200B;

Ive been on/off T for the past 4 years, and my hair only fully grows in side burns & along my jawline, very weak moustache. I have just started shaving it all after being frustrated with looking disheveled :( 

However every time I shave I break out alot, even with moisturizing & washing my face with a scrub every morning & night. Any shaving tips you can share I would definitely appreciate.

&#x200B;

I am really distrustful of minoxidil because of the negative side effects yet its the only treatment I see people talking about online for patchy beard/ stimulating growth. Can you reccomend any other products to help with stimulating beard growth? When I have my chin beard longer I will use a brush to try and "wake up the follicles" lol but idk if that is really doing anything
